flowchart TD
    %% Subagent-Driven Development — implementation authority:
    %% AGENTS.md §8-9, starter-init/SKILL.md, and spec-research/SKILL.md
    %% Palette: documents/diagrams/source/_shared/palette.md

    MAIN_AG["Main Agent Context Loop<br/>keeps context bounded; owns final decision"]:::agent

    MAIN_AG --> DECIDE{Spawning subagent<br/>useful for isolated task?}:::decision

    DECIDE -- No --> INLINE["Execute work inline in main context"]:::gate
    DECIDE -- Yes --> SPAWN["Spawn subagents with isolated context<br/>(Read-only for archaeology/research)"]:::core

    SPAWN --> SA_ARCH["Archaeology Subagent<br/>(/starter-init Phase A)<br/>read-only search / brownfield mapping"]:::external
    SPAWN --> SA_RES["Research Subagent<br/>(/spec-research SFE)<br/>bounded subsystem exploration"]:::external
    SPAWN --> SA_PAR["Implementation Subagent<br/>(/spec-implement task)<br/>isolated T-NNN scope"]:::external

    SA_ARCH -->|findings| R_ARCH["Summary Report A"]:::decision
    SA_RES -->|findings| R_RES["Summary Report B"]:::decision
    SA_PAR -->|findings| R_PAR["Summary Report C"]:::decision

    R_ARCH --> MERGE["Merge ONLY summary reports<br/>into main context<br/>Raw sweeps stay isolated"]:::core
    R_RES --> MERGE
    R_PAR --> MERGE

    MERGE --> MAIN_AG
    INLINE --> MAIN_AG

    NOTE["Rules:<br/>- Delegated subagents are an optional runtime capability<br/>- Subagents are not CoreBase SpecHarness routes<br/>- Raw tool outputs must never flood the main context window<br/>- Archaeology and research exploration must be read-only<br/>- Main agent always reviews subagent outputs and owns final decisions"]:::optional

